WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:07.024
Hi, I’m Starlight’s AI receptionist. When a renter calls after hours, I can answer with information your team has approved.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:16.767
If they want a viewing, I collect their name, callback number, and preferred time. Your team can confirm the details.

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:25.892
I send the enquiry details to your team so they know who to call back. Try the Starlight demo below.
